Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:11.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:17.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:24.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:30.39,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:47.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.85,0:00:53.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:01:00.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.47,0:01:06.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:12.64,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:24.09,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸一向将半妖犬夜叉当成族人的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对他非常的仇视
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:43.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照理说他也应该对人类非常的反感才对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:48.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的是杀生丸的手下邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身边却带着一个人类的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲被人给掳走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:02.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚奈落的分身神乐突然出现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把小玲给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:11.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管放一百万个心吧 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你肯乖乖听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证那个叫小玲的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:23.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会平安回到你的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:25.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落你这个大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要大功告成了 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:50.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你马上就会被我的这块肉消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候你就会成为我身体的一部分了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们沿路寻找四魂之玉碎片的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:03:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实大家都知道珊瑚的弟弟就是琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.25,0:03:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的体内被奈落藏了一块四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉单枪匹马进了奈落城
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:09.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有毒气还有瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:10.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里一定是奈落的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.27,0:03:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了 看见奈落城了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:27.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第81话 奈落大坏蛋下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:44.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:47.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋神乐 难道连你都制服不了他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:51.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也留意到了城外的动静了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我没那么多闲功夫陪你玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那一身的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那一身完美的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要变成我奈落的囊中物了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.41,0:04:30.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 这下糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷已经被…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人头杖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:41.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 千万不要有事才好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧 杀生丸少爷他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:42.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一身完美的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:44.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经被我完全给吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:49.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道？这就是你的原形吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.26,0:05:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会怕你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:24.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于找到你了 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:26.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我非消灭你不可
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别笑掉我的大牙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然也想要打败我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:33.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么看来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的犬夜叉 或许能把奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:40.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经将杀生丸的肉体化为己有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换句话说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不趁着奈落还没有完全取得妖力之前动手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.05,0:06:57.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等奈落完全消化那股妖力之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉恐怕就没机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是我失算
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:11.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到犬夜叉会采取这样的攻势
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你这臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那么容易破除我的结界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落你这个坏蛋 这次看你往哪逃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你使出吃奶的力气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也奈何不了我神通广大的奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放马过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再接我一招
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的命运跟杀生丸完全一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:19.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会变成我身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:20.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把杀生丸给…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:32.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子还是打不过奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.69,0:08:35.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在后悔已经太迟了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸已经变成我身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你这个半妖之力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底能给我补充多少能量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,献上来试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我的力量更壮大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.07,0:08:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不想跟那个小子死在一起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着受死吧 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:59.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次我不会放过你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:15.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.51,0:09:35.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说奈落 你不要笑死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包着我的那些肉片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:41.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然用来挡犬夜叉的风之伤 你真是幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落由我来收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:47.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是我的猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是开玩笑的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这小子一天到晚只会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:56.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个的狗命 今天全都是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃我一招
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:12.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为每次都有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃出我的手掌心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个死到临头还在作梦的死家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受死吧 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:32.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你的狗命
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.45,0:10:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了这个猎物是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:58.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:08.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天跟你玩到这儿 下次再来较量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:15.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:19.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为一辈子都能逃出我的手掌心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.59,0:11:22.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:24.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其想尽办法变身来追我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒不如早点去救跟着你的那位小姑娘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.31,0:11:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸身边的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:49.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲现在跟一个叫琥珀的人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:50.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟琥珀在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 相信你一定猜得到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:22.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸完美的妖力 就差那么一点就接收到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后关头居然功亏一篑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.38,0:12:27.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然变得这么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然不能凭一招半式解决他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:41.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落居然消失得无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:43.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚受了那么重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底会躲到什么地方去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:50.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落掳走了你的人质吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:53.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小玲难道是你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他掳走小玲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:58.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是为了争取时间逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个该死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷别扔下我耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪见 你先跟我说清楚再走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:23.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落跟杀生丸之间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:25.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你这种半妖 我没兴趣跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这件事说来话长啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:33.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就长话短说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.49,0:13:38.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲着我们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:47.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来又是这些妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.23,0:13:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子是不想让我们过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是琥珀回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还带了一个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像在哪里见过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部给我走开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:10.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去追他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.53,0:14:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 刚才有没有看到琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:24.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该来得及追上他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得四魂之玉碎片应该就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:29.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:30.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先走一步
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕太慢会让他们跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:40.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说琥珀受到了奈落的控制
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信是奈落在给琥珀下达命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比方叫他杀掉人质等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落为了争取时间逃出杀生丸手中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会故意布下这个局
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照你这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀带回来的那个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是杀生丸的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:15:00.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到一向把人命看得那么不值钱的杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身边居然跟着一个人类女孩 让人难以相信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.57,0:15:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有刚才他才被奈落耍了一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看他不会轻易放过奈落的手下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:12.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次杀生丸一定会杀了琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:14.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你哥哥杀生丸会杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 不管怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:21.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事一定不会有结局
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们必须比杀生丸抢先一步找到琥珀才行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.66,0:15:30.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想除了我之外也没有人拦得住杀生丸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:43.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么带我到这里来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚那间房子外面好像有人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们可以去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:52.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:37.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会这样 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:39.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想杀我是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:17:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:01.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子只不过昏过去而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸亏被我们给追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:06.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吧 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别想杀了琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你出来搅局的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:15.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个臭小子正打算扑上来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我好好较量较量呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:27.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这也是奈落的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落要他激怒杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:31.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后死在杀生丸手上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然会替我挡掉小鬼手中的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:50.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来不知道你有这么为哥哥着想的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再废话连篇了 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不放开你的手的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要砍下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:00.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准乱来 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:12.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:14.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.81,0:19:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个眼神真的让我很不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:38.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是不追啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:12.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你肯放过琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意送上门来要我杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于想通这一点了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:26.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过不想那么傻中了奈落的诡计罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.39,0:20:39.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算让我们赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:48.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说琥珀也走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:50.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.57,0:20:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我打赢奈落的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:53.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀就不会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不… 要是我们能够阻止他的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.34,0:20:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不能怪你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.05,0:21:03.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实只要琥珀还活着就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真搞不懂奈落那个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:08.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么突然间会失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上的伤那么重
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本连结界都张不了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留下解开结界的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:33.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:36.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是打算扔下整座城不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道 他又想要躲到别的地方去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.89,0:21:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:46.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得以前不管他藏在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:49.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都可以感觉到结界的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.86,0:21:53.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这次他真的完全消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:56.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也感觉不到奈落存在的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:22:01.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是到底为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.31,0:22:20.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.12,0:22:27.58,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:34.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:40.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:47.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:54.52,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.99,0:23:01.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:08.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:14.73,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:21.40,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.95,0:23:28.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.59,0:23:35.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.50,0:23:50.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 奈落这家伙太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.43,0:23:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明只差一点点就追上他了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.83,0:23:56.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 总算又回到现代来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.41,0:23:59.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我们两个是不是调换身分了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.91,0:24:00.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶 身分对调了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:02.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下怎么做预告
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法了 照这样继续往下说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.91,0:24:08.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奔波于现代与战国之间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.42,0:24:09.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得一定要收看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回我有精彩演出 别忘了收看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算又换回来了
